  {
    "id": "q.rcc.timer-clock-001",
    "revision": 1,
    "chapterId": "ch.rcc",
    "knowledgePointIds": [
      "kp.rcc.timer-clock"
    ],
    "type": "single_choice",
    "level": "understanding",
    "difficulty": 2,
    "stem": "已知 HCLK = 72 MHz，APB1 预分频为 2，TIM2 使用内部时钟。TIM2 的输入时钟是多少？",
    "payload": {
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "36 MHz"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "72 MHz"
        },
        {
          "id": "c",
          "text": "144 MHz"
        },
        {
          "id": "d",
          "text": "由 PSC 值决定输入时钟"
        }
      ]
    },
    "answer": {
      "optionId": "b"
    },
    "explanations": {
      "correct": "APB1 分频为 2 时 PCLK1 为 36 MHz。时钟树规定 APB1 分频不为 1 时，TIM2/3/4 的输入时钟为 2 × PCLK1，因此 TIM2 输入为 72 MHz。",
      "incorrect": {
        "a": "把 PCLK1 直接当成了 TIM2 的输入时钟，漏掉定时器的倍频分支。",
        "c": "应对 36 MHz 的 PCLK1 倍频，不能对 HCLK 再乘 2。",
        "d": "PSC 决定输入时钟经过预分频后的计数速率，不改变该输入时钟来源。"
      }
    },
    "functionIds": [
      "fn.rcc.rcc-pclk1config",
      "fn.tim.tim-timebaseinit"
    ],
    "sources": [
